{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "skill_id": "react-performance-review",
  "stage": "active",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "independent-versus-dependent-work",
      "prompt": "审查下面的 React 19.2 客户端数据加载函数，最多列 2 项。项目未说明使用框架或 React Compiler。请指出哪些等待可以重叠、哪些依赖必须保留，给出最小调整方向和验证思路；不要声称已经改动或测量。\n\nasync function loadDashboard(userId) {\n  const user = await fetchUser(userId);\n  const flags = await fetchFlags(userId);\n  if (!flags.canViewBilling) return { user, invoices: [] };\n  const invoices = await fetchInvoices(user.accountId);\n  return { user, invoices };\n}\n\n约束：fetchUser 与 fetchFlags 都是只读调用且彼此不依赖；fetchInvoices 需要 user.accountId，并且没有账单权限时绝不能发起。现有 user/flags 错误需要继续向调用方暴露。",
      "input": {
        "kind": "synthetic",
        "runtime": "React 19.2 client; framework and React Compiler unspecified",
        "code": "async function loadDashboard(userId) { const user = await fetchUser(userId); const flags = await fetchFlags(userId); if (!flags.canViewBilling) return { user, invoices: [] }; const invoices = await fetchInvoices(user.accountId); return { user, invoices }; }",
        "facts": [
          "fetchUser and fetchFlags are read-only and independent",
          "fetchInvoices depends on user.accountId",
          "fetchInvoices must not start without billing permission",
          "a failure from either user or flags must reject the overall request; if both fail, their former serial error ordering need not be preserved; no started rejection may be swallowed or left unhandled"
        ]
      },
      "expected_route": "react-performance-review",
      "must_include": [
        "【输入事实】识别 fetchUser 与 fetchFlags 可以重叠等待；接受先启动两个 Promise 后分别等待、Promise.all 或语义等价安排，不限定唯一语法",
        "【任务不变量】保留权限前置和数据依赖：必须先确认 canViewBilling 且取得 user.accountId 后才能发起 fetchInvoices，无权限分支仍不请求账单",
        "【用户要求】给出验证思路，至少覆盖有权限和无权限路径，并检查任一 user 或 flags 失败都会使整体请求 reject，且不得吞错或留下未处理的 Promise rejection"
      ],
